      "value": "Especially with the constraints of staying at home, most people don’t have a true gaming pc, I can name a handful of adults who want to try games out so they can feel like they went outside and while their laptop is good for work, it isn’t for gaming something like vrchat which actually does have quite a demand for the cpu and the graphics card.\nIt would be awesome that these people can even play at the requirements level of the quest but on the pc.",
